1
00:02:12,507 --> 00:02:16,218
Saya tak mahu pergi, tapi masanya dah tiba
untuk keluar dari Negara Blok!

2
00:02:16,219 --> 00:02:19,806
Saya harap di luar ini Elbaf!

3
00:02:22,267 --> 00:02:25,186
Kuasa Getah

4
00:02:25,770 --> 00:02:28,106
Senapang Kong!

5
00:02:36,573 --> 00:02:40,827
<i>"Pertembungan di Hamparan Salji
Loki, Sang Putera yang Dilaknat"</i>

6
00:02:48,251 --> 00:02:50,002
Di mana?

7
00:02:50,003 --> 00:02:52,338
Kapal Sunny!

8
00:02:54,215 --> 00:02:57,509
Topi Jerami!

9
00:02:57,510 --> 00:02:59,720
Hei, Topi Jerami!

10
00:02:59,721 --> 00:03:01,014
Keluarlah!

11
00:03:01,931 --> 00:03:05,518
Topi Jerami!

12
00:03:06,019 --> 00:03:07,060
Awak jumpa mereka?

13
00:03:07,061 --> 00:03:09,563
Tidak, saya tak jumpa apa pun

14
00:03:09,564 --> 00:03:11,106
tentang mereka!

15
00:03:11,107 --> 00:03:14,484
Kami dah cari di kawasan berdekatan!

16
00:03:14,485 --> 00:03:16,194
Takkanlah

17
00:03:16,195 --> 00:03:18,363
mereka tenggelam ke laut...

18
00:03:18,364 --> 00:03:19,866
Apa?

19
00:03:21,618 --> 00:03:24,871
Jadi, mari cari di dasar laut!

20
00:03:25,455 --> 00:03:28,874
Kru Lanun Gergasi! Terjun ke laut!

21
00:03:28,875 --> 00:03:30,000
Baiklah!

22
00:03:30,001 --> 00:03:31,209
Ya!

23
00:03:31,210 --> 00:03:34,421
Kami datang, Lanun Topi Jerami!

24
00:03:34,422 --> 00:03:35,840
Mari pergi!

25
00:03:38,801 --> 00:03:39,761
Eh?

26
00:03:40,345 --> 00:03:41,803
Baiklah!

27
00:03:41,804 --> 00:03:43,681
{\an8}Pahlawan Elbaf!

28
00:03:49,103 --> 00:03:50,647
Kamu ada jumpa apa-apa?

29
00:03:51,564 --> 00:03:54,234
Pencarian ditamatkan!

30
00:03:55,276 --> 00:04:00,406
Apa?

31
00:04:10,667 --> 00:04:12,501
Kenapa?

32
00:04:12,502 --> 00:04:15,295
Topi Jerami dan yang lain masih...

33
00:04:15,296 --> 00:04:19,633
Ya, kami cari merata-rata tapi
mereka tak kelihatan.

34
00:04:19,634 --> 00:04:22,511
Saya pasti mereka tak apa-apa.

35
00:04:22,512 --> 00:04:26,766
Lagipun, Sunny bukanlah kapal rapuh
yang senang tenggelam.

36
00:04:28,142 --> 00:04:29,268
Jadi...

37
00:04:29,269 --> 00:04:30,394
Awak kata apa...

38
00:04:30,395 --> 00:04:31,229
Ya.

39
00:04:32,855 --> 00:04:34,065
Mereka masih hidup!

40
00:04:34,649 --> 00:04:37,235
Mereka pasti masih hidup!

41
00:04:37,735 --> 00:04:38,986
Ya.

42
00:04:38,987 --> 00:04:42,740
Ini bukan kali pertama
kami terpisah begini.

43
00:04:45,827 --> 00:04:47,412
Betul kata Franky!

44
00:04:47,996 --> 00:04:49,579
Begitu.

45
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:51,790
Ia sudah masuk akal sekarang.

46
00:04:51,791 --> 00:04:53,251
Apa pendapat kamu, bos?

47
00:04:55,044 --> 00:04:57,170
Nampaknya sia-sia saja kita risau.

48
00:04:57,171 --> 00:05:00,216
Saya dah guna rakan-rakan jerung saya,

49
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:04,886
nampaknya tak ada tanda-tanda
Luffy dan yang lain dalam air.

50
00:05:04,887 --> 00:05:09,434
Jadi, kemungkinan mereka sudah terdampar
di sebuah pulau.

51
00:05:10,143 --> 00:05:14,605
Kamu sudah buat apa yang patut,

52
00:05:15,315 --> 00:05:17,649
dan bekalan makanan kapal ini
semakin habis.

53
00:05:17,650 --> 00:05:21,154
Tak ada gunanya jika kamu kebuluran
hanya untuk cari mereka.

54
00:05:22,655 --> 00:05:26,199
Terima kasih sebab cari mereka
seperti mereka kru kamu sendiri!

55
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:28,077
Saya rasa terharu.

56
00:05:28,661 --> 00:05:30,872
Kita semua menuju ke tempat sama.

57
00:05:32,582 --> 00:05:33,999
Begitu rupanya.

58
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,878
{\an8}Jika kru mereka sendiri kata begitu,
jadi, mereka tak apa-apa!

59
00:05:39,672 --> 00:05:41,799
Kita tunggu mereka di Elbaf.

60
00:05:42,675 --> 00:05:45,261
Baiklah, semua!

61
00:05:45,845 --> 00:05:48,097
Mari ke Elbaf!

62
00:05:53,644 --> 00:05:55,437
Mari bersulang untuk kepulangan kita!

63
00:05:55,438 --> 00:05:58,816
Bos, kita sudah kehabisan arak
dan makanan!

64
00:06:17,919 --> 00:06:21,547
Kita ada di luar, bukan?

65
00:06:22,590 --> 00:06:24,884
Sejuknya!

66
00:06:28,221 --> 00:06:29,847
Salji...

67
00:06:35,478 --> 00:06:36,395
Nami!

68
00:06:45,822 --> 00:06:46,948
Awak okey?

69
00:06:47,865 --> 00:06:49,158
Awak nak ke mana?

70
00:06:51,202 --> 00:06:54,247
Sejuklah! Patah balik ke sini!

71
00:06:55,248 --> 00:06:56,540
Sia-sia saja, Nami.

72
00:06:56,541 --> 00:07:01,212
Lagipun, bukannya ia mahu ikut kita.

73
00:07:02,755 --> 00:07:06,133
Nami, awak boleh ambil jubah saya
jika awak mahu.

74
00:07:06,134 --> 00:07:07,677
Terima kasih, Sanji.

75
00:07:08,261 --> 00:07:10,637
Awak begitu bodoh sampai
susah nak demam sekalipun cuba.

76
00:07:10,638 --> 00:07:12,890
Saya dengarlah, pemedang kelas bawahan!

77
00:07:13,933 --> 00:07:15,517
Tengok, Usopp!

78
00:07:15,518 --> 00:07:16,978
Apa?

79
00:07:19,188 --> 00:07:21,524
Besarnya!

80
00:07:22,608 --> 00:07:24,777
Pokok apa ini?

81
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:28,698
Adakah ia satu lagi ciptaan blok?

82
00:07:31,576 --> 00:07:32,535
Nami!

83
00:07:34,495 --> 00:07:36,580
Rasanya,

84
00:07:36,581 --> 00:07:38,874
berapa ribu tahun usianya?

85
00:07:38,875 --> 00:07:42,795
Semua pokok begitu!

86
00:07:45,047 --> 00:07:48,467
Besarnya! Itu gunung?

87
00:07:48,468 --> 00:07:53,013
Sama besar seperti satu pulau...
Bukan, ia lebih besar!

88
00:07:53,014 --> 00:07:54,097
Tunggu sekejap...

89
00:07:54,098 --> 00:07:57,268
Semuanya begitu luas sampai
saya rasa pening.

90
00:07:58,186 --> 00:07:59,812
Luar biasa...

91
00:08:00,396 --> 00:08:02,148
Hei, tengok ini!

92
00:08:07,445 --> 00:08:09,238
Luar biasa betul...

93
00:08:10,907 --> 00:08:14,285
Jambatan gantung ini panjang betul!

94
00:08:15,578 --> 00:08:20,290
Adakah ia naik ke awan?
Saya tak nampak penghujungnya.

95
00:08:20,291 --> 00:08:23,251
Tapi, di belakang kita
adalah istana Dewa Matahari.

96
00:08:23,252 --> 00:08:25,045
Kita tiada jalan lain selain ke hadapan.

97
00:08:25,046 --> 00:08:25,880
Apa?

98
00:08:26,464 --> 00:08:28,256
Awak takutkah, Usopp?

99
00:08:28,257 --> 00:08:30,592
Taklah! Ini hal kecil saja.

100
00:08:30,593 --> 00:08:33,971
Baiklah, ikut saya!

101
00:08:36,015 --> 00:08:37,974
Sekejap!

102
00:08:37,975 --> 00:08:39,519
Biar saya pergi dulu...

103
00:08:46,359 --> 00:08:47,193
Apa?

104
00:08:57,954 --> 00:08:59,287
Gergasi!

105
00:08:59,288 --> 00:09:01,122
{\an8}Mereka sedang merentasi jambatan!

106
00:09:01,123 --> 00:09:02,416
Mari bersembunyi!

107
00:09:03,084 --> 00:09:04,000
Luffy!

108
00:09:04,001 --> 00:09:05,211
Baik...

109
00:09:07,755 --> 00:09:09,422
Aduhai...

110
00:09:09,423 --> 00:09:12,510
Kenapalah Hajrudin ambil si pelik itu
ke dalam kru?

111
00:09:14,595 --> 00:09:18,223
Itu sebab dia pemandu arah yang mahir.

112
00:09:18,224 --> 00:09:19,850
Saya benci dia.

113
00:09:20,434 --> 00:09:22,853
Dialah yang memalukan Elbaf,
bukannya Loki!

114
00:09:23,479 --> 00:09:25,856
GERD, DOKTOR KAPAL,
LANUN GERGASI BAHARU

115
00:09:27,441 --> 00:09:30,611
Jangan cakap begitu,
ia akan buat Rodo gembira semula!

116
00:09:31,404 --> 00:09:33,697
GOLDBERG, TUKANG MASAK,
LANUN GERGASI BAHARU

117
00:09:33,698 --> 00:09:36,575
Hei, Piper, awak nampak, bukan?

118
00:09:36,576 --> 00:09:39,787
Awak nampak gagak dia bawa kapal kecil?

119
00:09:43,499 --> 00:09:46,418
{\an8}Penceroboh memang patut ditangkap,

120
00:09:46,419 --> 00:09:49,380
{\an8}tapi Rodo selalu jemput mereka masuk.

121
00:09:50,881 --> 00:09:53,550
Hobi dia betul-betul buat sakit kepala.

122
00:09:53,551 --> 00:09:56,596
Saya akan tangkap dia nanti
dan laporkan pada Ketua Jarul.

123
00:10:01,225 --> 00:10:03,059
Biar mereka lalu dulu.

124
00:10:03,060 --> 00:10:05,353
Kamu dengar tak, semua?

125
00:10:05,354 --> 00:10:08,690
Mereka kata Elbaf. Jadi ini mesti...

126
00:10:08,691 --> 00:10:10,234
Hei, diam!

127
00:10:10,943 --> 00:10:12,152
Luffy!

128
00:10:12,153 --> 00:10:13,236
Apa?

129
00:10:13,237 --> 00:10:14,821
Sembunyilah!

130
00:10:14,822 --> 00:10:16,657
Tapi, mereka macam orang baik.

131
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:19,784
Hei, semua! Tengok...

132
00:10:19,785 --> 00:10:23,538
Bodoh! Mereka kata penceroboh
akan ditangkap!

133
00:10:23,539 --> 00:10:25,124
Hei, Luffy!

134
00:10:25,708 --> 00:10:27,835
Dengarlah cakap Nami.

135
00:10:36,594 --> 00:10:39,221
Saya tahu ada gergasi wanita yang cantik!

136
00:10:43,976 --> 00:10:45,478
Mungkin tiada apa...

137
00:10:46,062 --> 00:10:46,937
Rasanya begitulah.

138
00:10:57,990 --> 00:11:00,242
Apa yang kamu buat?

139
00:11:03,037 --> 00:11:05,247
Rodo, awak ada di situ?

140
00:11:08,167 --> 00:11:09,709
Baiklah!

141
00:11:09,710 --> 00:11:12,379
Semua, ikut saya!

142
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:13,631
Ya!

143
00:11:17,385 --> 00:11:18,677
Mari pergi!

144
00:11:20,096 --> 00:11:22,223
Ia bergoyang!

145
00:11:24,016 --> 00:11:27,435
Jambatan gantung gergasi ini
ada banyak lubanglah.

146
00:11:27,436 --> 00:11:29,104
Nami, jangan risau.

147
00:11:29,105 --> 00:11:31,357
Saya dah biasa berjalan atas tali.

148
00:11:32,358 --> 00:11:34,026
Jadi, saya biasa dengan ini.

149
00:11:35,236 --> 00:11:38,363
Saya nampak ada emping salji besar.

150
00:11:38,364 --> 00:11:40,073
Jauh lagi perjalanan kita.

151
00:11:40,074 --> 00:11:42,993
Kita perlu cepat. Jika gergasi itu muncul,
kita tak ada tempat nak lari.

152
00:11:48,290 --> 00:11:52,002
{\an8}Ini cuma ujian!
Ujian pada mereka yang berani!

153
00:11:58,801 --> 00:12:01,928
Hutan di bawah ini penuh
dengan serigala gergasi.

154
00:12:01,929 --> 00:12:03,806
Lompat!

155
00:12:07,977 --> 00:12:09,019
Kenapa, Luffy?

156
00:12:09,895 --> 00:12:10,729
Awak rasa tak?

157
00:12:16,485 --> 00:12:17,735
Ada satu perasaan aneh!

158
00:12:17,736 --> 00:12:19,154
Ya.

159
00:12:19,155 --> 00:12:21,906
- Saya tak mahu pergi.
- Kalau begitu...

160
00:12:21,907 --> 00:12:24,409
Lumut yang tak pandai arah ini pun
tak boleh pergi!

161
00:12:24,410 --> 00:12:26,828
ia tak boleh berada dekat dengan hutan!

162
00:12:26,829 --> 00:12:30,123
Benda itulah yang mengaum
sewaktu kita dalam Negara Blok!

163
00:12:30,124 --> 00:12:30,958
Rasanya.

164
00:12:32,209 --> 00:12:34,879
- Kamu semua pergi dulu!
- Apa?

165
00:12:38,632 --> 00:12:40,008
Hei, tunggu, Luffy!

166
00:12:40,009 --> 00:12:41,801
Awak nak ke mana, Luffy?

167
00:12:41,802 --> 00:12:44,388
Ada banyak serigala di bawah!

168
00:12:50,394 --> 00:12:52,520
Beranikan diri, Usopp...

169
00:12:52,521 --> 00:12:55,524
Beranikan diri, Usopp!

170
00:13:10,623 --> 00:13:12,832
Apa?

171
00:13:12,833 --> 00:13:14,542
{\an8}Kami

172
00:13:14,543 --> 00:13:16,670
{\an8}menyerang Egghead?

173
00:13:17,379 --> 00:13:19,632
Ya, ia ada dalam akhbar hari ini.

174
00:13:20,674 --> 00:13:22,926
Kenapa mereka menipu begitu?

175
00:13:22,927 --> 00:13:24,302
Tengok.

176
00:13:24,303 --> 00:13:26,095
{\an8}SURAT KHABAR DUNIA
MARIN

177
00:13:26,096 --> 00:13:28,182
{\an8}Ia terlalu kecil. Saya tak boleh baca.

178
00:13:28,933 --> 00:13:29,892
{\an8}Biar saya bacakan.

179
00:13:33,312 --> 00:13:35,397
{\an8}<i>"Selepas berdiam diri selama 100 tahun,</i>

180
00:13:35,898 --> 00:13:38,234
{\an8}<i>Kumpulan Lanun Gergasi telah kembali!</i>

181
00:13:42,571 --> 00:13:45,323
<i>Bersama dengan Luffy si Topi Jerami,
seorang Maharaja Laut,</i>

182
00:13:45,324 --> 00:13:47,368
<i>mereka telah bakar Egghead
sehingga rentung.</i>

183
00:13:50,913 --> 00:13:51,829
{\an8}DIKEHENDAKI
DORRY, BROGY

184
00:13:51,830 --> 00:13:53,832
{\an8}<i>Kapten bagi Kru Lanun Gergasi,</i>

185
00:13:54,583 --> 00:13:56,043
<i>Broggy si Gergasi Merah,</i>

186
00:13:56,627 --> 00:13:58,212
<i>serta Dorry, si Gergasi Biru,</i>

187
00:13:58,796 --> 00:14:02,007
{\an8}<i>mempunyai ganjaran setinggi
1.8 bilion beri setiap seorang."</i>

188
00:14:03,133 --> 00:14:06,053
Sebanyak 1.8 bilion?

189
00:14:06,637 --> 00:14:08,389
Mereka beri kepala awak
ganjaran yang tinggi!

190
00:14:10,307 --> 00:14:12,976
{\an8}Saya tak ada sebut "kembali" ke apa-apa...

191
00:14:12,977 --> 00:14:17,230
Ganjaran bos dahulunya cuma 100 juta
setiap seorang.

192
00:14:17,231 --> 00:14:18,940
Ia sudah melonjak tinggi!

193
00:14:18,941 --> 00:14:21,861
{\an8}Nilai sudah berbeza daripada
100 tahun lalu.

194
00:14:22,444 --> 00:14:26,031
Itu ganjaran sesuai bagi
kapten pahlawan Elbaf.

195
00:14:26,574 --> 00:14:27,949
Nilai...

196
00:14:27,950 --> 00:14:30,368
{\an8}Nilainya berbeza, ya?

197
00:14:30,369 --> 00:14:33,162
{\an8}Ya, rasanya.

198
00:14:33,163 --> 00:14:37,375
Ia juga mengatakan kapten kami
telah bunuh Vegapunk.

199
00:14:37,376 --> 00:14:38,711
Apa?

200
00:14:39,795 --> 00:14:42,298
Mereka putar belit cerita seperti selalu.

201
00:14:44,258 --> 00:14:45,633
Dia bunuh saya!

202
00:14:45,634 --> 00:14:49,054
Diamlah. Dia cuba lindungi awak
hingga akhir, bukan?

203
00:14:51,974 --> 00:14:53,684
Tapi, saya tak tahu

204
00:14:54,184 --> 00:14:56,436
bila gambar ini diambil.

205
00:14:56,437 --> 00:14:58,439
Mungkin di suatu masa sewaktu
kita di Egghead.

206
00:14:59,273 --> 00:15:02,025
Konco berita WEJ ada merata-rata,

207
00:15:02,026 --> 00:15:05,905
dan gambar sesiapa pun
boleh dijual dengan harga tinggi.

208
00:15:06,906 --> 00:15:07,865
Hei.

209
00:15:09,366 --> 00:15:12,911
Bila Luffy tukar ke bentuk bebasnya,

210
00:15:12,912 --> 00:15:14,747
adakah tanda ini muncul di tangannya?

211
00:15:15,497 --> 00:15:18,583
Ya, saya dapat lihat satu tanda di situ.

212
00:15:18,584 --> 00:15:23,713
Dia ada itu? Dia selalu bergerak,
jadi, saya tak tengok betul-betul.

213
00:15:23,714 --> 00:15:25,174
Ia nampak aneh pada saya.

214
00:15:26,050 --> 00:15:29,594
Tangannya kabur, namun tanda itu jelas.

215
00:15:29,595 --> 00:15:31,597
Pelik betul untuk tumpukan hal itu.

216
00:15:32,264 --> 00:15:34,058
Saya macam pernah lihat itu.

217
00:15:36,018 --> 00:15:40,397
Apa pun, tak sangka Topi Jerami
kita setara dengan si Rambut Merah!

218
00:15:40,981 --> 00:15:45,860
Saya dengar ada anak muda bernama Hajrudin
dari Elbaf jadi orang bawahannya!

219
00:15:45,861 --> 00:15:48,905
Hajrudin! Dia ialah anak lelaki raja.

220
00:15:48,906 --> 00:15:50,740
Maksud awak, Raja Elbaf?

221
00:15:50,741 --> 00:15:51,866
Betulkah?

222
00:15:51,867 --> 00:15:55,704
Dia cuma budak nakal yang ganas
sewaktu kecil.

223
00:16:02,252 --> 00:16:06,131
Mereka yang mahu jemput kamu...

224
00:16:12,638 --> 00:16:15,556
<i>Namun, ada sedikit masalah di Elbaf.</i>

225
00:16:15,557 --> 00:16:18,185
Itu sebabnya veteran macam kami
yang pergi.

226
00:16:18,769 --> 00:16:19,978
Masalah?

227
00:16:19,979 --> 00:16:22,106
{\an8}Saya baru tahu itu.

228
00:16:24,775 --> 00:16:25,984
Ya...

229
00:16:25,985 --> 00:16:29,989
Ia berlaku semasa bos tiada.

230
00:16:34,952 --> 00:16:39,707
<i>Raja ada seorang lagi anak,
kali ini anak luar perkahwinan.</i>

231
00:16:59,143 --> 00:17:01,353
Sejuknya!

232
00:17:07,860 --> 00:17:10,237
Besar betul!

233
00:17:16,035 --> 00:17:20,246
Blok mainan memang seronok,
tapi beginilah pengembaraan sepatutnya!

234
00:17:20,247 --> 00:17:25,293
Siapa pun yang mengaum dengan kuat itu.

235
00:17:25,294 --> 00:17:28,505
Pasti bagus jika dia berikan saya
daging yang besar.

236
00:17:34,303 --> 00:17:35,429
Hei!

237
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:39,266
Awak di mana?

238
00:17:43,771 --> 00:17:45,689
Apa yang kamu mahu?

239
00:18:14,009 --> 00:18:15,302
Suara itu

240
00:18:15,803 --> 00:18:16,887
dari sana.

241
00:18:20,307 --> 00:18:22,226
<i>Anak baharu itu...</i>

242
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:26,563
Anak baharu itu dikenali sebagai
Putera yang Dilaknat.

243
00:18:27,147 --> 00:18:28,106
Dilaknat?

244
00:18:28,107 --> 00:18:30,650
Dia lakukan segala jenis kejahatan,

245
00:18:30,651 --> 00:18:34,362
jadi dia telah dirantai
selama beberapa tahun,

246
00:18:34,363 --> 00:18:35,864
tapi dia hampir terlepas

247
00:18:36,490 --> 00:18:39,576
<i>sehingga segerombolan pahlawan
menyerbu dan tangkap dia.</i>

248
00:18:41,662 --> 00:18:44,247
Segerombolan Gergasi Elbaf?

249
00:18:44,248 --> 00:18:46,207
Dahsyat betul!

250
00:18:46,208 --> 00:18:50,337
Ya, dia memang gila.

251
00:19:00,222 --> 00:19:02,515
<i>Didorong nafsu haloba
untuk dapatkan Buah Syaitan Legenda</i>

252
00:19:02,516 --> 00:19:05,269
<i>yang diwarisi turun-temurun
melalui kerabat diraja Elbaf,</i>

253
00:19:05,769 --> 00:19:09,397
<i>dia telah membunuh ayahnya sendiri,
Sang Raja,</i>

254
00:19:09,398 --> 00:19:11,400
<i>dan memakan buah itu.</i>

255
00:19:15,195 --> 00:19:17,823
<i>Adakah nama dia...</i>

256
00:19:22,369 --> 00:19:23,744
Betul.

257
00:19:23,745 --> 00:19:26,373
Jika dia terlepas lagi,

258
00:19:27,875 --> 00:19:30,210
<i>dunia pasti hancur.</i>

259
00:19:31,044 --> 00:19:32,629
<i>Dialah...</i>

260
00:19:34,923 --> 00:19:37,176
<i>Aib negara Elbaf!</i>

261
00:19:40,929 --> 00:19:43,015
<i>Putera yang Dilaknat...</i>

262
00:19:45,058 --> 00:19:46,268
<i>Loki!</i>

263
00:20:01,408 --> 00:20:03,118
Sebut nama awak!

264
00:20:06,455 --> 00:20:07,664
Saya Luffy.

265
00:20:08,665 --> 00:20:10,792
Sayalah orang yang akan jadi Raja Lanun!

266
00:20:15,589 --> 00:20:16,881
Raja?

267
00:20:16,882 --> 00:20:17,716
Ya.

268
00:20:18,217 --> 00:20:20,134
Saya di mana? Awak siapa?

269
00:20:20,135 --> 00:20:22,887
Apa? Awak datang tanpa tahu?

270
00:20:22,888 --> 00:20:23,722
Ya.

271
00:20:26,683 --> 00:20:31,021
Betul juga. Jika awak tahu di mana awak,
pasti awak tak datang jumpa saya.

272
00:20:32,231 --> 00:20:34,316
Jadi, biar saya beritahu!

273
00:20:40,155 --> 00:20:43,450
Inilah Negara Pahlawan Elbaf,

274
00:20:44,493 --> 00:20:46,119
Negara Perang!

275
00:20:54,795 --> 00:20:57,798
<i>Negara yang pernah abdikan diri kepada
konflik tak berpenghujung.</i>

276
00:21:00,050 --> 00:21:03,095
<i>Negara yang terkuat!</i>

277
00:21:08,058 --> 00:21:12,854
{\an8}ELBAF

278
00:21:14,606 --> 00:21:16,065
{\an8}Serta

279
00:21:16,066 --> 00:21:18,694
{\an8}sayalah orang yang akan
musnahkan dunia ini.

280
00:21:21,655 --> 00:21:23,991
Sayalah Dewa Matahari,

281
00:21:25,117 --> 00:21:26,492
<i>Loki!</i>

282
00:21:26,493 --> 00:21:30,539
{\an8}BERSAMBUNG

283
00:23:05,383 --> 00:23:07,635
<i>Luffy bertembung Loki, Putera Dilaknat,</i>

284
00:23:07,636 --> 00:23:10,138
<i>seorang penjenayah yang pernah
menggegarkan Elbaf.</i>

285
00:23:10,722 --> 00:23:13,891
<i>Loki mengatakan dia ada maklumat
tentang Shank si Rambut Merah</i>

286
00:23:13,892 --> 00:23:16,644
<i>dan menawarkan Luffy satu perjanjian.</i>

287
00:23:16,645 --> 00:23:20,648
<i>Apakah niat sebenar Loki?</i>

288
00:23:20,649 --> 00:23:22,525
<i>Episod seterusnya dalam</i> ONE PIECE!

289
00:23:22,526 --> 00:23:25,945
<i>"Perjanjian Berbahaya!
Loki Penguasa Kegelapan dan Luffy"</i>

290
00:23:25,946 --> 00:23:28,073
<i>Saya akan jadi Raja Lanun!</i>

291
00:23:30,742 --> 00:23:35,622
{\an8}Terjemahan sari kata oleh Fikri D. Dali

